{"availability":"available","full":"virtualsteve-star/chat-playground","name":"chat-playground","description":"A low-cost approach to testing AI chat experiences and security concepts","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"JavaScript","stars":41,"forks":11,"created":"2025-04-08T02:59:57Z","updated":"2026-05-30T00:19:01Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://virtualsteve-star.github.io/chat-playground/","topics":["appsec","llm","llm-security","owasp"],"demo":"https://virtualsteve-star.github.io/chat-playground/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T16:43:41.869Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T16:43:41.869Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T16:43:41.869Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T16:43:41.869Z","stars":41,"forks":11}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A companion project to The Developer's Playbook for Large Language Model Security and the OWASP Top 10 for LLM Applications, this open-source HTML/JavaScript application provides a hands-on environment for experimenting with various chat models, personalities, guardrails and user interfaces locally, quickly and with zero connectivity or cost.","With the rapid evolution of LLM and Generative AI technology (new models, techniques, agents, etc.), it's become increasingly challenging for developers to find a practical starting point for hands-on experimentation. This playground addresses that need by offering:","Features a zero-dependency SimpleBot model and simple keyword-based guardrails for rapid prototyping and testing of chat experiences without external API costs, perfect for understanding the fundamental security properties of LLM interactions. (see personalities)"],"features":["Multiple Models: From simple local pattern-matching to powerful API models (OpenAI and Google Gemini). Some models have vulnerabilities and back doors for testing and experimentation (see models)","Different Views: Various UI styles to understand how different interfaces affect user experience","Guardrails: Both simple local filters and advanced AI-powered content moderation (see guardrails, see extensibility)","Zero Dependencies: Everything runs in the browser, making it easy to get started","Clean, intuitive chat interface"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/virtualsteve-star/chat-playground/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"d743f31887084f2e8f9d8c0fa404ed97a836504ab77196f731b73350fef6b9f5","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T16:43:41.966Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T16:43:41.966Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A companion project to The Developer's Playbook for Large Language Model Security and the OWASP Top 10 for LLM Applications, this open-source HTML/JavaScript application provides a hands-on environment for experimenting with various chat models, personalities, guardrails and user interfaces locally, quickly and with zero connectivity or cost.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/virtualsteve-star/chat-playground/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"Features a zero-dependency SimpleBot model and simple keyword-based guardrails for rapid prototyping and testing of chat experiences without external API costs, perfect for understanding the fundamental security properties of LLM interactions. (see personalities)","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/virtualsteve-star/chat-playground/blob/main/README.md"}],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"For the full experience including API-powered personalities and advanced guardrails, you'll need to enter your API key(s).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/virtualsteve-star/chat-playground/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"For API-powered, advanced features, you'll be prompted to enter your API key when you first select a feature that requires it.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/virtualsteve-star/chat-playground/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"d743f31887084f2e8f9d8c0fa404ed97a836504ab77196f731b733